codex
The root cause is now concrete: this sandbox exposes `/proc/self/exe` but not `/proc/<current-pid>/exe`; Lean 4.22 hard-codes the latter when locating its application, so both Lake configuration detection and `lean` fail. I’m applying a narrow, auditable `readlink` shim only to the rerun process so `/proc/<pid>/exe` resolves via `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter any frozen or generated input.
apply patch
